# Identity hotspots

Read `docs/PERF_IDENTITY.md` before changing these files for speed.

- `app-loader.tsx`: static-import both loader pages. `readLoaderMode()` stays theme-then-session. Unmount **children** while overlay is open, never the loader itself.
- `CustomCursor.tsx`: stay mounted. Idle = dim/scale. `chromeQuiet` may hide it. No idle unmount.
- `Eye*.tsx`: `looping = !reduce`. Gaze springs may rest; blinks may not.
- `TimeTravelOverlay.tsx`: keep `data-time-travel` for the overlay lifetime. `data-era-swapping` lasts until reveal, not 120ms.
- `registry.tsx`: `next/dynamic` unused era homepages only.
- `layout.tsx`: keep `@fontsource/.../latin-400.css` for Architects Daughter and Nothing You Could Do.
- Quiet attrs: `data-era-picker-active`, `data-time-travel`, `data-module-open` (see `useChromeQuiet.ts`).
